<article class="env-lemma" id="0GN6">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0GN6">Lemma <span data-tag="0GN6">30.10.4</span>.</a> Let $X$ be a Noetherian scheme. Every quasi-coherent $\mathcal{O}_ X$-module is the filtered colimit of its coherent submodules. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This is a reformulation of Properties, Lemma <a href="/tag/01PG" data-tag="01PG">28.23.3</a> in view of the fact that a finite type quasi-coherent $\mathcal{O}_ X$-module is coherent by Lemma <a href="/tag/01XZ" data-tag="01XZ">30.9.1</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>